==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 3.33~13.33 seconds<sup>100f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 3.33~13.33 seconds<sup>100f~400f</sup>.
*1 [[Mooth]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*1 [[Condemned Peng]] spawns after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.
*4 [[Owlbrow]]s spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 50~56.67 seconds<sup>1,500f~1,700f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Wicked Face]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Mooth]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 46.67~53.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,600f</sup>.
**3 [[Condemned Peng]]s spawn, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A basic midranger can deal with the enemies here easily. The Owlbrows can be exhausted before hitting the base if one wishes to do so.

